  "hamiltonian": "H = -t sum_<ij>,s (c+_is c_js + h.c.) - t' sum_<<ij>>,s (c+_is c_js + h.c.) + U sum_i n_i,up n_i,dn on the periodic Lx x Ly torus",
  "site_index": "site (i, j) is i * Ly + j",
  "configuration": "(2N,) int8 +-1 occupations, the N spin-up modes first",
